.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-mcp-spawn 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-mcp\-spawn \- Record that a client actually spawned this server, then exec the launch line unchanged
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten mcp spawn\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIserver\fR> <\fIcommand\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record that a client actually spawned this server, then exec the launch line unchanged
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIserver\fR>
The server this launch is for, as the spawn ledger and `mcp\-attach\-check` name it
.TP
<\fIcommand\fR>
The launch line, run verbatim — Batten execs it and does not supervise it
